Tonight's stocking stuffer is...

00:10:19.601 --> 00:10:24.868
a Nintendo Switch,
OLED-model system,

00:10:24.868 --> 00:10:26.234
"Splatoon 3" game,

00:10:26.234 --> 00:10:30.267
and a 3-month subscription to
Nintendo Switch online.

00:10:30.267 --> 00:10:31.534
-That's right, Jimmy.

00:10:31.534 --> 00:10:34.701
This holiday, splat the halls
with "Splatoon 3,"

00:10:34.701 --> 00:10:36.968
the new game from Nintendo
where you compete with friends

00:10:36.968 --> 00:10:38.367
and splash the most ink.

00:10:38.367 --> 00:10:40.834
Play on your TV
or handheld or tabletop

00:10:40.834 --> 00:10:43.133
with the Nintendo Switch
OLED mode.

00:10:43.133 --> 00:10:44.133
Who knows?

00:10:44.133 --> 00:10:45.467
You may even get
splatted by Jimmy

00:10:45.467 --> 00:10:48.734
when he's playing online,
via Nintendo Switch online,

00:10:48.734 --> 00:10:51.100
which means you'll all get,
for free for three months,

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.934
so much fun.

00:10:52.934 --> 00:10:54.701
Jimmy?

00:10:54.701 --> 00:10:57.133
-Thank you!

00:10:57.133 --> 00:10:59.567
Thank you to our friends
at Nintendo.

00:10:59.567 --> 00:11:01.100
Enjoy your gift, guys.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.300
We'll be right back with
Kate Hudson!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.501
Congratulations!

00:11:04.501 --> 00:11:06.501
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

